@no-ssl-verify
### Register Admin User
POST http://localhost:8443/v1/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Register a New User
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo1",
  "password": "demo123",
  "role": "guest"
}

